<cell id="cell-0"><cell_type>markdown</cell_type># Depth Model Comparison for Corn Seed Images

Benchmark 6 monocular depth models on 200 random corn seed images.
Each model has its own install + run cell — skip any that fail without breaking the rest.

**GPU:** A100 (40GB)
**Models:** Depth Pro · MoGe-2 · DepthFM · Pixel-Perfect Depth · VGGT · Depth Anything V3</cell>
<cell id="cell-1"><cell_type>markdown</cell_type>## 1. Mount Drive & Clone Repo</cell>
<cell id="cell-2">from google.colab import drive
drive.mount('/content/drive')

!git clone -b colab https://github.com/shurjo05/DepthComparison.git /content/DepthComparison 2>/dev/null || (cd /content/DepthComparison && git pull)
%cd /content/DepthComparison</cell>
<cell id="cell-3"><cell_type>markdown</cell_type>## 2. Set Dataset Path</cell>
<cell id="cell-4">import os

os.environ["DATASET_DIR"] = "/content/drive/MyDrive/Corn Seed Dataset/test"

img_dir = os.path.join(os.environ["DATASET_DIR"], "images")
lbl_dir = os.path.join(os.environ["DATASET_DIR"], "labels")
assert os.path.isdir(img_dir), f"Not found: {img_dir}"
assert os.path.isdir(lbl_dir), f"Not found: {lbl_dir}"
print(f"✓ {len([f for f in os.listdir(img_dir) if f.endswith('.jpg')])} images found")</cell>
<cell id="cell-5"><cell_type>markdown</cell_type>## 3. Base Install + Select Samples</cell>
<cell id="cell-6">!pip install -q "transformers>=4.48" pillow opencv-python-headless numpy scipy trimesh
!python depth_comparison/select_samples.py
!nvidia-smi</cell>
<cell id="cell-7"><cell_type>markdown</cell_type>## 4. Restore Saved Outputs (run this if continuing from a previous session)</cell>
<cell id="cell-8">import shutil, os

src = "/content/drive/MyDrive/Corn Seed Dataset/depth_comparison_outputs"
dst = "/content/DepthComparison/depth_comparison"

if os.path.isdir(src):
    for item in os.listdir(src):
        s = os.path.join(src, item)
        d = os.path.join(dst, item)
        if os.path.isdir(s):
            if os.path.exists(d):
                shutil.rmtree(d)
            shutil.copytree(s, d)
        else:
            shutil.copy2(s, d)
    restored = [f for f in os.listdir(dst) if os.path.isdir(os.path.join(dst, f))]
    print(f"✓ Restored: {restored}")
else:
    print("No saved outputs found — starting fresh")</cell>
